   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clarifications and asking for help",
     "texto": [
      "When you don't understand the other person, you say: «Sorry, ik begrijp het niet» (Sorry, I don't understand). Notice the negation with «niet» for actions. To politely ask for repetition: «Kunt u dat herhalen?» (Could you repeat that, please?). To ask someone to speak more calmly: «Kunt u langzaam praten?» (Could you speak slowly?). Polite replies: «Natuurlijk. Geen probleem!» (Of course, no problem!)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
